{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "job_story_014mir_3000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_014mir_3001_p", "source_sha256": "a05cb41f88a2b3acb6ccb9e15f9d20e2384f244df3f687063c5f1e54a157e46b", "ja": "（未来が時代劇のお芝居に、茶店の娘役で出演中だ。\nどんな演技を見せてくれるのか、楽しみだな）", "zh": "（未来在目前参与的时代剧剧场，扮演茶店女儿的角色。\n不晓得她会表现出什么样的演技，真期待。）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "job_story_014mir_3000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_014mir_3002_014mir", "source_sha256": "46de4f3d740947ebc5a0138244485f9df07e5b6e601fdc5ea1867e1662338da7", "ja": "{$P$}さん、お疲れさまです！\n今日も頑張りますよ～！", "zh": "{$P$}先生，辛苦你了！\n我今天也会加油的～！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "job_story_014mir_3000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_014mir_3003_014mir", "source_sha256": "e38f6193e72e9ecf4e21bf0e39311ef1536abff81517192d094b97c5786b86a2", "ja": "あ、そうだ！　演出家さんに、今日はお侍さんに\n持っていくお茶菓子、アドリブでいいって言われて…。", "zh": "啊，对了！导演跟我说\n今天准备给武士的茶点，我可以自由发挥……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "job_story_014mir_3000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_014mir_3004_014mir", "source_sha256": "f7a213eb229c9b4ab3ff5dfc3d9899deed011735eb345e2e3cd991ea7b1e0334", "ja": "{$P$}さんは、\nどんなお菓子がいいと思いますか？", "zh": "{$P$}先生\n觉得准备什么点心比较好？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "job_story_014mir_3000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_014mir_3005_p", "source_sha256": "12a7e0a93f4b8e4aea5fabdf36823ebae9eaf712737362eaceefae754763fcc8", "ja": "そうだな。たとえば……", "zh": "这个嘛，比如说……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "job_story_014mir_3000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_014mir_3006", "source_sha256": "323bff28ecf1dff62c3aad938249702621f2fc37f9599b2966013c941ad06925", "ja": "だいふく", "zh": "大福", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "job_story_014mir_3000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_014mir_3007", "source_sha256": "2a34358cb28b19098cb340cb9eb49469b0ed1626d587a2b93894b106c1446ed8", "ja": "ショートケーキ", "zh": "草莓蛋糕", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "job_story_014mir_3000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_014mir_3200_p", "source_sha256": "0cb3e9239a28e37e1b749e9c80d5e94873749c59e733970f66aa4488eec2d246", "ja": "いつものお団子じゃなくて、だいふくはどうだ？", "zh": "有别于常见的团子，准备大福如何？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "job_story_014mir_3000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_014mir_3201_014mir", "source_sha256": "5c2bbd668a3e48a5b7ee8fd2cb5cbfab82a22e9a886ee8a1eb148844f5ecf85d", "ja": "あ、いいですね！　なんか、時代劇っぽいです！", "zh": "啊，不错耶！感觉很有时代剧的风格！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "job_story_014mir_3000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_014mir_3202_014mir", "source_sha256": "00de3a12db6c0412f739e7e2562727b9fe32c6c0ba0aad83c8cc9beb9aebc377", "ja": "おもちが伸びたら、見た目も面白いし……\nスタッフさんに聞いてみますね♪", "zh": "而且如果有麻糬被拉长的画面，看了也会觉得有趣……\n我去问问看工作人员♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "job_story_014mir_3000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_014mir_3300_p", "source_sha256": "0cb3e9239a28e37e1b749e9c80d5e94873749c59e733970f66aa4488eec2d246", "ja": "いつものお団子じゃなくて、だいふくはどうだ？", "zh": "有别于常见的团子，准备大福如何？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "job_story_014mir_3000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_014mir_3301_014mir", "source_sha256": "470b771af78b5da83b716cbbe6c1ac42bea6d0b4a05f4005a0cb83fd8b13ec03", "ja": "だいふく……あっ、下に小判とか入れるやつですね！\nでっへっへっへ……お主も悪よのう～♪", "zh": "大福……啊，就是在下面塞小判的那个吧！\n嘿、嘿、嘿……客官也真坏呀～♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "job_story_014mir_3000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_014mir_3500_p", "source_sha256": "f1182396de42547fc2df8ff4005fadf5651bef9f763278deca06120f25f5c12b", "ja": "イチゴのショートケーキにしてみよう。", "zh": "试试看端出草莓蛋糕吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "job_story_014mir_3000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_014mir_3501_014mir", "source_sha256": "7ba5eba293a8aa11270617253e1302124b011feae9691c7dc7f08951a687d942", "ja": "わぁ～！　そんなのお侍さん、絶対喜びますよ～！\nだって、生クリームですもん♪", "zh": "哇～！那样武士绝对会很开心的～！\n因为有鲜奶油呀♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "job_story_014mir_3000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_014mir_3502_014mir", "source_sha256": "0f1b2ab1fe87791e6f305e67cfbe30f7c2c9e1f79c7a375cdaace849f117df03", "ja": "イチゴショートなら、緑茶じゃなくて、紅茶の方が\nいいかも……？　大変、急いで準備しなくっちゃ！", "zh": "如果是草莓蛋糕的话，应该别配绿茶，\n配红茶好像更好……？糟糕，得赶紧去准备才行！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "job_story_014mir_3000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_014mir_3600_p", "source_sha256": "f1182396de42547fc2df8ff4005fadf5651bef9f763278deca06120f25f5c12b", "ja": "イチゴのショートケーキにしてみよう。", "zh": "试试看端出草莓蛋糕吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "job_story_014mir_3000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_014mir_3601_014mir", "source_sha256": "b58fcb205d68185cfbbd094f8285b4ad4749a87a16dfddd89ceb7c0ddefb19ce", "ja": "イチゴショート……すごいアイディアです！\n……あれ、でもこのお芝居って、江戸時代ですよね？", "zh": "草莓蛋糕……好棒的点子！\n……咦？可是这出戏的时间背景是江户时代吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "job_story_014mir_3000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_014mir_3602_014mir", "source_sha256": "a2f049540f1c9b909cdeb11902b14f51295db26aa2ad6a4779466927b484e6a4", "ja": "生クリームもおいしいけど……うーん、ここはあんこ！\nあんこのショートケーキにしましょうっ！", "zh": "虽然鲜奶油也很好吃……唔～就改成红豆馅吧！\n就准备红豆馅的蛋糕！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
